  "note": "M8 Task 2 (spec 5.5): the free fonts that tier-B PowerPoint (Windows) PDFs embed and that neither this PC nor Office's cloud fonts provide (PowerPoint for Microsoft 365 downloads the Office cloud fonts a deck uses on its own, e.g. Montserrat, Nunito, Fira Sans, Aptos Black; a second copy of another version makes the render differ from the PDF). Installed for the current user with harness/fonts/install-fonts.ps1 -LockPath <this file>. Static TrueType files only, every url pinned to a commit, family = nameID 1 as the PDFs name it. retired: the cloud-font families an earlier version of this lock installed. Not the list public test decks may embed (that is fonts.lock.json). M8 round 1c (spec 5.5): Catamaran (static files of its original repository, the PDFs embed Regular, Bold and Light), Ledger, Economica and Geologica (OFL-1.1) added; the installer still skips any family that is an Office cloud font (M8-R4).",
